Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.07,0:00:06.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.25,0:00:26.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.65,0:00:29.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't think I'm exactly hero material.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.15,0:00:31.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor! Noor!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.23,0:00:33.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.45,0:02:21.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it. Are you hurt?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.93,0:02:23.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm all right. I'm fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.67,0:02:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, it all makes so much sense to me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.15,0:02:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank you, Rolo, for all your help. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.93,0:02:32.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.59,0:02:35.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dragon calmed down\Njust like you told it to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.31,0:02:37.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You really saved my butt. What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.61,0:02:39.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, I didn't. It wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.49,0:02:41.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.40,0:02:42.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Come on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.32,0:02:44.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It totally just stopped\Nattacking all of a sudden.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.23,0:02:47.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, you know it was because of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.09,0:02:47.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.00,0:02:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That definitely wasn't me.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.89,0:02:50.72,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.55,0:02:54.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There are people out\Nthere scared of my power.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.55,0:02:56.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and really hate that I have it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.75,0:02:57.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.03,0:03:01.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The dragon is docile now, but\Nit knew Rolo could control it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.95,0:03:03.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,no matter how ferocious it got.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.77,0:03:04.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was intimidated.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.37,0:03:06.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I getcha.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.79,0:03:10.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Whatever you say, Rolo, we'll\Njust leave it at that. Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.61,0:03:15.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, since that's done, can I\Nmaybe ask you for a favor? I guess.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.11,0:03:18.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know this might sound a little odd?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.45,0:03:19.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But could you send this dragon back?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.89,0:03:21.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,to where it came from?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.13,0:03:23.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We cannot let it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.67,0:03:25.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's too dangerous for sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.65,0:03:29.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Logic tells us that we should probably\Njust kill the thing right now!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.29,0:03:35.25,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean even i know that but if we could\Ni really don't want to kill this fella.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.87,0:03:44.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I know it's kind of\Nselfish of me to say that
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.53,0:03:47.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but could you maybe\Njust cut it some slack?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.31,0:03:55.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, if that's what you really want.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.25,0:03:59.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Rolo, can you do it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.53,0:04:01.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:03.13,0:04:09.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I mean, given how powerful it is,\Nthe best I can do is just ask nicely.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.31,0:04:12.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.79,0:04:13.97,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You're safe, Kate.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.53,0:04:16.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Neither of them are afraid of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.65,0:04:36.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, here I go.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.01,0:04:50.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, uh...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.01,0:04:52.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it, Rolo?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.73,0:04:55.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It said it would do\Nanything its master orders.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.33,0:04:57.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Uh, master?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.39,0:05:00.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This dragon really said that to you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.71,0:05:03.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, this hardly seems real.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.87,0:05:05.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't believe it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.79,0:05:09.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Crazy to think such a massive\Ncreature would call Rolo its master.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.29,0:05:10.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, then...
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.31,0:05:11.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.43,0:05:15.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Tell the big guy to pack up and quietly\Ngo back to wherever it came from.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.61,0:05:20.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, also, while we're at it, tell it not\Nto mess with any more humans, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.21,0:05:21.04,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.21,0:05:22.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I can try.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.89,0:05:42.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It understands.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.93,0:05:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's going to agree to\Neverything you asked for.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.45,0:05:46.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wow, that's amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.09,0:05:50.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yeah, it sure is.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.95,0:05:54.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.15,0:06:24.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's gone. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.97,0:06:53.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, it couldn't have worked out\Nanymore in our favor than that.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.03,0:07:00.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even a dragon that has lived for thousands
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.39,0:07:03.33,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,of years is still a\Nstupid beast in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.59,0:07:05.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Nothing more than my pawn.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.55,0:07:10.32,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I thought nothing would\Nbe left of the capital.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.95,0:07:13.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.29,0:07:16.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Commence attack. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.93,0:07:46.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,hmm you are certain this\Nwill bring an end to
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.61,0:07:49.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the clay's kingdom because\Ni am not backing down
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.87,0:07:53.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,A well-known beast tamer\Nhas already awakened
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.15,0:07:55.86,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Dragon of Calamity\Nand brought it to heal.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.61,0:07:59.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I guess it was worth the\Nexorbitant price they demanded.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.71,0:08:04.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And of course, after the dragon goes\Non a rampage, our forces will follow.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.13,0:08:08.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All foot soldiers will be equipped\Nwith magic swords and magic shields,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.47,0:08:12.18,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,while the elite troops will have\Nmagic armor and magic cannons.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.81,0:08:14.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Furthermore, we'll have three Aegises,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.89,0:08:17.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the Mobile Mana Bulwark\NGeneration of Icen,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.63,0:08:20.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And four of the ultra-high-output\Nmana-ray weapons,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.23,0:08:23.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,the devastating Brionacal.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.49,0:08:25.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Just splendid.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.97,0:08:26.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Excellent work.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.21,0:08:28.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please wait, Your Majesty.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:33.55,0:08:34.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Out with it?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.81,0:08:36.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What have you to say, Randeus?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.59,0:08:38.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Pardon my bluntness,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.07,0:08:42.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but I just do not see how this war can\Npossibly benefit our country in the long run.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.03,0:08:43.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.63,0:08:47.41,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I beg you to reconsider.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.41,0:08:51.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Know your place.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.91,0:08:53.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I said I've heard enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.25,0:08:57.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No one can threaten us.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:58.07,0:09:01.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We stand at the forefront of\Ntechnology and magical prominence.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.87,0:09:04.64,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And we will make sure\Nthe whole world knows it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.25,0:09:11.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In the near future, people will tell\Nbut one tale of the Klai's kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.59,0:09:16.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It was a country of fools who neglected\Nproper upkeep of the Dungeon of the Lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.07,0:09:20.39,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,led down a path to ruin by\Ntheir own selfish greed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.75,0:09:22.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Meanwhile,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.73,0:09:25.53,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,we shall be remembered as\Nthe humanitarian force that
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.61,0:09:28.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,liberated the people from\Ntheir imbecile of a monarch.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.13,0:09:32.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,History has no need for\Nmultiple storytellers.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.57,0:09:35.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One truth is all the people can handle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.91,0:09:36.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.09,0:09:39.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,See? It's over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.83,0:09:46.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Okay, is it alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.83,0:09:47.79,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't know.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.11,0:09:49.40,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We need to get closer.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.07,0:09:50.90,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.45,0:09:58.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's the Magical Empire.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.79,0:10:00.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare to fire. Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:01.25,0:10:03.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My testy, take a look. Yes, what is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:13.89,0:10:15.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That is the princess, is it not?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.69,0:10:19.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Next to her is Ines, the Divine Shield.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.99,0:10:23.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,One of the living legends\Nknown all around the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.87,0:10:26.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perhaps she is the reason\Nwhy the royal capital
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.17,0:10:28.76,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,has not been completely\Nrazed to the ground.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:29.49,0:10:30.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Isn't this perfect?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.99,0:10:34.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Because the era where legends\Nrule has come to an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.31,0:10:37.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We now live in an era that is\Ndefined by those with wisdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:38.41,0:10:41.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire the Brionac at them\Nimmediately! Yes, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.61,0:10:50.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,She may be the divine shield,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.41,0:10:53.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but the heat of the Brionac\Nwill evaporate her into nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.83,0:10:58.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Yet another one of their so-called\Nlegends will die horrifically by my hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.61,0:11:01.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, what beautiful bliss.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.73,0:11:05.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is why I simply adore war. Ready!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.77,0:11:09.19,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The Brionac is prepared to launch!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.35,0:11:12.31,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Everything is prepared, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.01,0:11:28.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Fire!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.43,0:11:40.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This is the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.73,0:11:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:56.95,0:12:00.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Lindbergh, please,\Nstand back. Oh, Rolo!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.37,0:12:13.20,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Mary!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:37.31,0:12:38.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait, what just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.89,0:12:43.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There must have been a misfire due to a\Nproblem with the mana condensation process.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.11,0:12:45.88,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You halfwits, prepare\Nthe next one immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.33,0:12:49.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, that was too close.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.03,0:12:51.74,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the heck was that light?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.17,0:12:54.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And oh my gosh, look at all those people.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:54.93,0:12:56.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,You said that was the Imperial Army?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.95,0:12:59.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Looks like Dorytus III\Nhas mobilized his troops.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.33,0:13:03.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's like he has an\Nendless supply of warriors.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:04.19,0:13:06.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't understand what's happening here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:06.37,0:13:09.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,All I can say is Dorytus\Nhas brought this force.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.83,0:13:11.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,with the purpose of\Ndestroying our kingdom.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.79,0:13:12.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.70,0:13:16.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We have our army at the capital,\Nbut not enough for those numbers.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.49,0:13:20.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Lady Lindbergh, we should go now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.39,0:13:21.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We are of no use here.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:24.45,0:13:28.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I agree let's go back and meet up with\Nmy brother what do you think instructor?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.89,0:13:34.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Given the situation Do you need\Nto ask there's really no choice
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.17,0:13:37.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but to get our butts out of\Nhere yes I understand That was
Dialogue: 0,0:13:37.63,0:13:40.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,silly of me why is she smiling\Nyou'd think she'd be more
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.89,0:13:45.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Terrified, obviously, we should\Nattack's incoming. Everyone behind me.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.79,0:13:49.67,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Divine shield
Dialogue: 0,0:13:59.95,0:14:03.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Well, this is aggravating,\Nyour majesty, please you
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.43,0:14:06.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,might want to take cover\Nin the rear finish the job
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.13,0:14:13.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Quickly they're gonna keep
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.13,0:14:14.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,us pinned here like this
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.35,0:14:18.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,guess there's only really\None way out instructor?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.35,0:14:21.09,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is it? I'm going to buy us some time.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.33,0:14:25.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll get all their attention focused on\Nme You can use that as a chance to escape.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.83,0:14:27.36,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,That's what you want to do
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.81,0:14:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not great at fighting\Nbut running away there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.81,0:14:34.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm kind of an expert
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.59,0:14:45.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I used to go hunting for honeycomb all the
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.99,0:14:48.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,time and was always\Ngetting attacked by bees
Dialogue: 0,0:14:48.81,0:14:51.99,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,If I just run around like\Ncrazy, things will work out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:54.15,0:14:55.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm going to be fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.25,0:14:58.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I plan on coming back\Nalive, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.09,0:15:01.92,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm okay,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.00,0:15:06.44,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,but at least allow me to offer you the\None thing I can do to help, all right?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.63,0:15:07.95,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Sure, go right ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.81,0:15:16.49,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Must be some defense magic. Here we go.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.71,0:15:17.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Prepare for impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.35,0:15:20.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What? Impact? What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.79,0:15:23.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I promised to control the output\Nthis time, so don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.95,0:15:24.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It'll be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.93,0:15:26.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hold on a sec, Lin.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.31,0:15:30.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I didn't mean going on some kind of\Ncrazy suicide mission. Over there!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.71,0:15:32.83,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's another one of those lights!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:36.29,0:15:37.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The next one's on its way!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:38.33,0:15:40.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,We're leaving everything\Nin your hands, Instructor!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.95,0:15:41.78,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Go forth!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.93,0:15:43.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,And Godspeed! Oh, crap.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.23,0:15:45.94,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm not ready for the impact.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:46.37,0:15:47.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Physical enhancement!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.39,0:16:00.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Oh, man.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.85,0:16:02.03,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Thank God I'm alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.85,0:16:08.68,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Perry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.97,0:16:12.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Good to know I can deflect those.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.13,0:16:16.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In that case, Perry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.01,0:16:19.85,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,It's working!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.23,0:16:27.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My momentum is too strong to change\Ncourse, so here goes nothing!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.63,0:16:29.61,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'll take it as far as I can!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.69,0:16:37.52,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.91,0:16:47.62,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The more time I can buy, the\Nbetter chance they have to escape!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.35,0:16:52.12,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm just going to run around and\Nparry every single thing I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.77,0:16:54.60,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Parry!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.03,0:17:07.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.09,0:17:29.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Our weapons are gone!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:29.63,0:17:30.75,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey, what happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.41,0:17:32.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Where'd my weapons go?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.63,0:17:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,They're up there!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.01,0:17:35.07,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Defend yourselves!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.21,0:17:36.50,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I don't have a shield!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.27,0:17:54.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What are those up in the air?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.81,0:18:10.71,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the devil just happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.43,0:18:20.55,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.75,0:18:21.73,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:22.55,0:18:24.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What the hell is happening?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.27,0:18:33.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.97,0:18:38.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Hey.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.05,0:18:49.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Wait a second. Were you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:50.87,0:18:52.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This just doesn't make sense.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.85,0:18:54.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He was way over there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.71,0:18:56.77,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How did he cover all that distance?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.61,0:19:01.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is looking at me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.45,0:19:05.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He pays no mind to the\NImperial Guards, just me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.03,0:19:07.80,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He must know I am the Emperor.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.41,0:19:10.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,In which case, I must be his target.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:22.95,0:19:25.13,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Ah, he's going to kill me!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.49,0:19:32.47,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But wait, I have my kaiser armor and\Nkaiser sword, both made of orichalcum.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.55,0:19:44.38,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.47,0:19:45.37,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.73,0:19:47.08,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Have a change of heart?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.01,0:20:06.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Why the hell are our cannons\Nsticking out of the ground like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.09,0:20:11.15,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,What in God's name is going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.19,0:20:15.21,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I had 10,000 soldiers that\Nwere all perfectly equipped
Dialogue: 0,0:20:15.29,0:20:18.35,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,and aegesis that can defend\Nagainst dragon's breath.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.93,0:20:21.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Even the Brionac can\Nburn dragons to a crisp.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.81,0:20:24.58,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,How are they now all\Nbroken down and worthless?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:27.31,0:20:32.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Please, you must tell me who you are\Nand why haven't you killed me yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.55,0:20:35.43,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,No, not that weapon.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.07,0:20:45.11,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,King Clay's Black Blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.15,0:20:51.91,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The one dungeon relic I covet above\Nall others. Why does this man?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.99,0:20:58.17,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,have it no don't be wait that\NSword is made from an unknown metal
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.25,0:21:02.51,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,it's supposed to be too heavy for\Nany normal human to carry I have
Dialogue: 0,0:21:02.59,0:21:06.59,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,heard even that freakishly strong\Nking needed both hands to wield it
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.11,0:21:09.93,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,There's no way anyone\Ncould surpass King Clay's.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:14.65,0:21:17.65,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,But that's the only way to\Nexplain what I'm seeing.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.83,0:21:19.29,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,This man has done it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.93,0:21:22.45,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,My God, he did all of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.11,0:21:24.05,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.49,0:21:27.57,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,The only reason I am still\Nalive is because he wants me to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.65,0:21:31.06,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,endure the torture of humiliation\Nbefore finishing me off.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.51,0:21:32.69,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I just know it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.77,0:21:37.01,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,He is going to do to me exactly what\NI was planning to do to King Clays.
Dialogue: 1,0:22:04.48,0:22:09.44,Freehand 471 BT,,0,0,0,,{\an8\fs37}#9 I Parry an Army
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.77,0:23:06.23,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I love you, and I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:12.77,0:23:15.63,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:15.71,0:23:16.87,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:17.91,0:23:18.81,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,I'm so
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.89,0:23:25.89,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:27.15,0:23:29.27,Dubtitles,,0,0,0,,Love, Give, Me!

